  "title": "Volcano Classic Vaporizer (taxes extra)",
  "description": "ALL STORZ ARE REGULAR STOCK\n\nVOLCANO HYBRID ALSO IN STOCK\n\nThe Volcano Classic is the ultimate balloon filling desktop vaporizer. Ultra reliable, German Engineering, super easy to use, great vapor, it truly delivers. Thanks to a valve system and storage balloon, users can inhale at their own pace (10 minutes maximum). If you can afford the Volcano and want the best balloon vaporizer, make the choice to buy one today.\n\nFeatures:\nVolcano Classic\nManual Temperature Control\nTemp range of 130C to 226C\nForced Air Vaporizer\nRemovable Filter\n110V AC Adapter\n3 Year Manufacturer Warranty\nUnit Weight: 2.6 lb / 1.2 kg\nUnit Dimensions: 7″H * 8″L * 8″W\nShipping Box Dimensions: 9.75″H * 10″L * 10″W\n\nEasy Valve Set Includes:\n4* Easy Valve Balloons (pre-made)\n1* Easy Valve Balloon with Adapter\nFilling Chamber with Cap\nLiquid Pad\nNormal Screen Set\nCleaning Brush\n\nAccessory Package (extra $15)\n1 Solid valve boxes of bags\n1 Easy valve Screen Set\n2 Cleaning Sticks\n1 Cleaning Brush\n\nSolid Valve Kit Available\nOnly $97.49, click here\n\nVolcano Classic Warranty Information\nVisit the manufacturer website for warranty information\nhttps://www.storz-bickel.com/shop_us/en/support/",
  "description_html": "<p><b>ALL STORZ ARE REGULAR STOCK</b></p>\n<p><strong>VOLCANO HYBRID ALSO IN STOCK</strong><b><br /></b></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #666666\"><strong><span style=\"font: 400 15px/21px &apos;Helvetica Neue&apos;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align: left;text-transform: none;text-indent: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none;display: inline !important;white-space: normal;float: none;background-color: transparent\"><span style=\"color: #666666;font-family: &apos;Helvetica Neue&apos;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">The Volcano Classic is the ultimate balloon filling desktop vaporizer. Ultra reliable, German Engineering, super easy to use, great vapor, it truly delivers. Thanks to a valve system and storage balloon, users can inhale at their own pace (10 minutes maximum). If you can afford the Volcano and want the best balloon vaporizer, make the choice to buy one today.</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #666666\"><strong><br />Features:<br /></strong>Volcano Classic</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Manual Temperature Control</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Temp range of 130C to 226C</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Forced Air Vaporizer</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Removable Filter</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">110V AC Adapter</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">3 Year Manufacturer Warranty</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Unit Weight: 2.6 lb / 1.2 kg</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Unit Dimensions: 7&#8243;H * 8&#8243;L * 8&#8243;W</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Shipping Box Dimensions: 9.75&#8243;H * 10&#8243;L * 10&#8243;W</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #666666\"><strong>Easy Valve Set Includes:</strong></span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">4* Easy Valve Balloons (pre-made)</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">1* Easy Valve Balloon with Adapter</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Filling Chamber with Cap</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Liquid Pad</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Normal Screen Set</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Cleaning Brush</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #666666\">Accessory Package (extra $15)</span></strong><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">1 Solid valve boxes of bags</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">1 Easy valve Screen Set</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">2 Cleaning Sticks<br />1 Cleaning Brush</span><span style=\"color: #666666\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #666666\"><strong>Solid Valve Kit Available</strong></span><span style=\"color: #666666\"><strong><br /></strong></span>Only $97.49, <a href=\"https://vaporizers.ca/products/volcano-solid-valve-kit\" title=\"Volcano Solid Valve Set\">click here</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #666666;font-size: 15px\"><a href=\"https://vaporizers.ca/pages/review-volcano-classic-and-digit-desktop-vaporizer\" style=\"margin: 0px;text-align: left;color: #666666;text-transform: none;line-height: 21px;text-indent: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;font-weight: 400;text-decoration: underline;white-space: normal;background-color: transparent\" title=\"Volcano Classic &amp; Digit Review\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0266/5065/files/button-readourreview_large.jpg?v=1508355401\" alt=\"\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #666666\">Volcano Classic Warranty Information</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">Visit the manufacturer website for warranty information</span><br /><span style=\"color: #666666\">https://www.storz-bickel.com/shop_us/en/support/</span><br data-id=\"product-description\" aria-label=\"Description\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;padding-right: 0px;padding-bottom: 0px\" role=\"textbox\" id=\"tinymce\" class=\"mce-content-body\"></p>",
